error[NK1197]: Put parentheses around a bit operation next to a comparison.
  --> tests/a_bit_operation_in_a_head_wants_parentheses.nika:7:13
   |
 7 | 		true if m == 1 << 3 => "eight",
   |             ^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: Nikaia binds `&`, `|`, `^` and the shifts tighter than a comparison, and C binds them looser, so without parentheses the line can be read two ways.
   = help: Write `m == (1 << 3)`.
